WEBVTT

00:00:07.590 --> 00:00:09.730
Ugh, don't yawn in <i>public</i>, Senpai.

00:00:10.180 --> 00:00:13.150
Sorry. But cut me some slack, okay?

00:00:13.150 --> 00:00:16.000
Natsuki-chan gave me a pile of homework yester—

00:00:21.620 --> 00:00:23.580
La Folia's coming to Japan?

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:28.770
The Kingdom of Aldegyr and the
Lost Warlord's Dominion are going to hold a

00:00:28.770 --> 00:00:32.770
signing ceremony for the extension of their
mutual non-aggression treaty soon.

00:00:32.770 --> 00:00:33.840
That's probably why.

00:00:33.840 --> 00:00:35.730
Signing ceremony?

00:00:35.730 --> 00:00:39.340
If I recall correctly, the Lost Warlord's
Dominion is Vatler's country, isn't it?

00:00:39.340 --> 00:00:40.810
Why are they holding it here?

00:00:40.810 --> 00:00:44.060
Both countries have a long history with each other,

00:00:44.060 --> 00:00:48.610
so they decided to host it in neutral territory: Itogami Island, Japan.

00:00:50.780 --> 00:00:53.650
Well, I guess that means they're not here for me.

00:00:54.420 --> 00:00:56.550
And since La Folia's here for work,

00:00:56.550 --> 00:00:58.700
she's probably really busy.

00:00:59.330 --> 00:01:01.320
I hope so.

00:01:05.160 --> 00:01:06.170
Senpai!

00:01:08.630 --> 00:01:11.250
I need your help, Akatsuki Kojou!

00:01:11.250 --> 00:01:12.630
La Folia?

00:01:11.250 --> 00:01:12.630
La Folia-san?

00:01:17.050 --> 00:01:18.920
La Folia.

00:01:18.920 --> 00:01:20.390
You're not getting away from me!

00:01:21.300 --> 00:01:22.720
A demon!

00:01:22.720 --> 00:01:23.850
Sekkarou!

00:01:24.980 --> 00:01:26.980
Are you trying to get in my way, little girl?!

00:01:34.570 --> 00:01:36.030
Hey, old man!

00:01:39.160 --> 00:01:40.620
Freeze!

00:01:41.090 --> 00:01:42.790
Are you alright, Your Majesty?

00:01:43.460 --> 00:01:44.700
"Your Majesty"?

00:01:47.030 --> 00:01:48.210
That old man is...

00:01:52.430 --> 00:01:53.900
The King of Aldegyr?

00:01:54.880 --> 00:01:56.420
Father!

00:01:56.420 --> 00:01:59.430
This man is the Fourth Progenitor
and the man who took my first kiss,

00:02:00.400 --> 00:02:01.760
Akatsuki Kojou!

00:03:42.640 --> 00:03:46.580
Hey, La Folia, what the hell are you doing?

00:03:46.580 --> 00:03:50.040
Look, just play along, Kojou.

00:03:51.550 --> 00:03:53.290
And why is he dressed like a viking?

00:03:53.290 --> 00:03:56.710
That's the traditional clothing
of the village my dad is from!

00:03:56.710 --> 00:03:59.260
So <i>you're</i> Fourth Progenitor?

00:04:00.350 --> 00:04:03.590
You seem disappointing for a Progenitor.

00:04:04.110 --> 00:04:07.340
Elders and nobles need <i>impact</i>.

00:04:08.120 --> 00:04:10.100
Mind your own business!

00:04:10.100 --> 00:04:12.830
So she's from the Lion King Organization,

00:04:12.830 --> 00:04:15.690
dispatched here to be the Fourth Progenitor's mistress!

00:04:16.690 --> 00:04:17.370
My mistress?!

00:04:17.370 --> 00:04:18.560
You've got it all wrong!

00:04:18.560 --> 00:04:21.650
I'm a Sword Shaman,
and I'm here to keep an eye on him!

00:04:22.330 --> 00:04:23.780
Isn't that right, Senpai?

00:04:23.780 --> 00:04:24.840
Yeah!

00:04:24.840 --> 00:04:27.120
So I'd appreciate it if you didn't
create more misunderstandings!

00:04:30.040 --> 00:04:33.730
Even if that were the case,
I wouldn't have a problem with it.

00:04:33.730 --> 00:04:35.370
Great men like to indulge.

00:04:35.370 --> 00:04:40.510
It wouldn't be unusual for
a Progenitor to have multiple mistresses.

00:04:40.510 --> 00:04:44.760
If you keep on insisting that I marry someone,

00:04:44.760 --> 00:04:47.720
then I shall choose him as my groom!

00:04:48.850 --> 00:04:50.050
Marry?!

00:04:51.850 --> 00:04:52.860
Listen.

00:04:52.860 --> 00:04:56.690
I'm not telling you to get married because I'm fine with <i>any</i> groom.

00:04:56.690 --> 00:04:58.290
Well, actually...

00:04:58.290 --> 00:04:59.660
Um...

00:04:59.660 --> 00:05:02.570
Oh, my. I told you this would happen.

00:05:03.110 --> 00:05:05.320
She'd jump straight to
choosing Kojou-san herself.

00:05:06.420 --> 00:05:07.790
Polifonia?

00:05:07.790 --> 00:05:08.830
Mother?!

00:05:09.970 --> 00:05:11.330
La Folia.

00:05:11.330 --> 00:05:16.130
Your father has misgivings about
your relationship with the Fourth Progenitor.

00:05:16.130 --> 00:05:19.800
Which is why he is having
you get engaged to someone else.

00:05:21.100 --> 00:05:23.980
My name is Polifonia Rihavein.

00:05:23.980 --> 00:05:28.220
I've heard you're friends with my daughter and my half-sister, Akatsuki Kojou-san.

00:05:28.220 --> 00:05:29.910
Half-sister?

00:05:29.910 --> 00:05:31.350
She's means Kanon-chan.

00:05:31.740 --> 00:05:36.060
She's also the daughter of the last king, La Folia-san's grandfather.

00:05:36.060 --> 00:05:39.720
Technically, that makes her the current queen's sister.

00:05:39.720 --> 00:05:41.190
Oh, I see...

00:05:41.570 --> 00:05:44.630
I would love to continue this chat,

00:05:44.630 --> 00:05:48.320
but I don't want to burden the employees any further.

00:05:50.190 --> 00:05:54.460
Kojou-san and Ms. Sword Shaman,

00:05:54.460 --> 00:05:56.330
we're hosting a party tonight, actually.

00:05:56.820 --> 00:05:59.830
I'd like to invite you both.

00:06:10.110 --> 00:06:12.430
Looks like security is tight.

00:06:12.430 --> 00:06:15.470
I can't find an opening.

00:06:16.460 --> 00:06:19.400
Is he... the Fourth Progenitor?!

00:06:45.370 --> 00:06:47.380
At the end of the day, we got dragged into her mess.

00:06:48.060 --> 00:06:49.500
I expected as much.

00:06:49.500 --> 00:06:51.980
We're talking about La Folia-san here.

00:06:52.520 --> 00:06:56.680
Anyways, security's on high alert tonight, huh?

00:06:57.080 --> 00:07:00.520
Well, I guess that's the kind of
treatment you'd expect for royalty.

00:07:01.090 --> 00:07:03.520
They're probably on the lookout for terrorists.

00:07:03.520 --> 00:07:04.300
Terrorists?

00:07:04.300 --> 00:07:09.740
It seems that there's going to be
suspicious activity during tonight's ceremony.

00:07:10.300 --> 00:07:13.160
Coming here in a state-of-the-art armored airship,

00:07:13.510 --> 00:07:16.080
and announcing the wrong arrival date

00:07:16.080 --> 00:07:17.640
are most likely in response to that.

00:07:23.090 --> 00:07:25.750
Kings have it rough, eh?

00:07:27.080 --> 00:07:29.710
I'm glad I'm just a commoner.

00:07:29.710 --> 00:07:34.130
That's hard to believe
coming from the Fourth Progenitor.

00:07:34.130 --> 00:07:37.430
Oh? I've never seen you dressed that sharp!

00:07:38.080 --> 00:07:41.210
You look pretty handsome, Kojou!

00:07:41.210 --> 00:07:42.440
Asagi!

00:07:42.440 --> 00:07:44.260
Why are you here?

00:07:44.260 --> 00:07:47.780
We suddenly got the
invitation this afternoon.

00:07:47.780 --> 00:07:49.150
Yaze!

00:07:49.150 --> 00:07:53.990
Looks like they invited anyone and
everyone who knows you or Kanon-chan.

00:07:53.990 --> 00:07:54.990
Take a look.

00:07:55.410 --> 00:07:56.240
Huh?

00:07:57.940 --> 00:08:00.450
Hi there, Kojou-kun!

00:08:00.450 --> 00:08:01.580
Nagisa?!

00:08:02.010 --> 00:08:05.210
You said you were staying
the night at a friend's house!

00:08:06.240 --> 00:08:10.010
Actually, Kanon-chan asked me to be with her today,

00:08:10.010 --> 00:08:12.900
because she's meeting some of her relatives!

00:08:12.900 --> 00:08:14.930
Astarte, you're here too?

00:08:15.250 --> 00:08:19.180
Yes, because Master also received an invitation.

00:08:19.620 --> 00:08:20.920
I see.

00:08:20.920 --> 00:08:24.690
Makes sense, since Kanase is staying with you all.

00:08:24.690 --> 00:08:26.460
Of course you'd get invited.

00:08:26.460 --> 00:08:28.190
So where's Natsuki-chan?

00:08:29.850 --> 00:08:31.820
Most likely, she will be late due to her work.

00:08:31.820 --> 00:08:33.300
Oh.

00:08:33.300 --> 00:08:34.320
Yukina!

00:08:35.780 --> 00:08:39.540
You're so cute! That outfit
looks great on you, Yukina!

00:08:39.540 --> 00:08:40.540
Kirasaka?

00:08:40.540 --> 00:08:41.500
Sayaka-san?

00:08:42.060 --> 00:08:42.970
What's wrong?!

00:08:42.970 --> 00:08:44.790
You're here, too, Akatsuki Kojou?

00:08:44.790 --> 00:08:46.630
Why are you here?

00:08:46.630 --> 00:08:47.620
I'm working!

00:08:47.620 --> 00:08:49.670
I have to go to a security meeting tomorrow.

00:08:49.670 --> 00:08:50.790
Oh, I see.

00:08:50.790 --> 00:08:52.800
Because tonight's ceremony
involves the Lost Warlord's Dominion.

00:08:53.670 --> 00:08:55.400
Which means... Oh, shit!

00:08:55.400 --> 00:09:01.470
For better or for worse, Alge Alko isn't here tonight.

00:09:01.470 --> 00:09:05.000
He's off escorting tonight's attendees from overseas.

00:09:06.900 --> 00:09:07.860
Kojou!

00:09:07.860 --> 00:09:09.730
Onii-san! Yukina-chan!

00:09:20.340 --> 00:09:24.120
I'm glad you two could make it,
Onii-san, Yukina-chan!

00:09:24.560 --> 00:09:29.460
You two look exactly alike in
those dresses, Kanase, La Folia.

00:09:29.460 --> 00:09:31.080
We look like we could be sisters!

00:09:31.080 --> 00:09:33.880
Though, in reality we're aunt and niece.

00:09:33.880 --> 00:09:37.840
I've heard that I have even
more relatives back in Aldegyr.

00:09:38.850 --> 00:09:40.900
I almost can't believe it.

00:09:40.900 --> 00:09:44.430
Everyone has been so welcoming to me.

00:09:46.440 --> 00:09:48.900
Everyone, I have Onii-san to thank for all this.

00:09:48.900 --> 00:09:50.860
No, I didn't do that much.

00:09:51.570 --> 00:09:53.790
Kanon, don't tell me you too have fallen for him!

00:09:53.790 --> 00:09:59.700
Oh? Kanon and I both love Kojou very much, Father!

00:10:00.570 --> 00:10:05.660
You wretch! Just how many girls have you sunk your teeth into?!

00:10:05.660 --> 00:10:06.660
His teeth?

00:10:08.980 --> 00:10:10.210
Unbelievable!

00:10:10.210 --> 00:10:12.000
Do you understand now, Father?

00:10:12.000 --> 00:10:14.460
Kanon and I aren't the only ones.

00:10:14.460 --> 00:10:16.000
Yukina-san was the first,

00:10:16.000 --> 00:10:20.680
but almost all of the girls invited tonight are Kojou's mistresses.

00:10:21.070 --> 00:10:22.370
Wow!

00:10:22.370 --> 00:10:27.100
I gathered everyone
here to learn more about them,

00:10:27.100 --> 00:10:30.730
but it seems that we can skip the talk!

00:10:57.490 --> 00:10:58.550
Unbelievable!

00:10:59.080 --> 00:11:01.010
Please get out of here, Your Majesty!

00:11:01.010 --> 00:11:01.900
No!

00:11:01.900 --> 00:11:04.140
Prioritize the guests' safety over us!

00:11:04.590 --> 00:11:06.770
Don't let anyone get hurt!

00:11:09.340 --> 00:11:10.820
We're getting out of here, Asagi!

00:11:10.820 --> 00:11:12.080
Where's Nagisa-chan?

00:11:12.080 --> 00:11:14.520
She's in the bathroom.
But what about Kojou and the others?

00:11:14.520 --> 00:11:17.740
They're with the king.
They're in much better hands than us!

00:11:33.720 --> 00:11:35.170
Execute.

00:11:35.170 --> 00:11:36.590
Rhododactylos!

00:11:42.180 --> 00:11:43.390
Not on my watch!

00:11:46.340 --> 00:11:47.410
Senpai!

00:11:47.410 --> 00:11:49.600
I'll take care of the outside.
Can I leave the inside to you?

00:11:49.600 --> 00:11:50.230
All right!

00:11:53.420 --> 00:11:55.360
I'm not in the mood for this!

00:11:59.700 --> 00:12:02.450
Come to me, Regulus Aurum!

00:12:09.610 --> 00:12:10.970
Are you okay?

00:12:10.970 --> 00:12:12.650
Y-Yes!

00:12:14.460 --> 00:12:18.210
I'm sorry. I'm so relieved that I can barely move.

00:12:25.410 --> 00:12:27.320
Thank you! You saved my life.

00:12:27.320 --> 00:12:28.970
Thank you very much!

00:12:28.970 --> 00:12:30.390
Senpai!

00:12:30.390 --> 00:12:32.200
Akatsuki Kojou!

00:12:34.940 --> 00:12:35.560
Kojou!

00:12:36.110 --> 00:12:38.350
Thank you! You saved us!

00:12:39.800 --> 00:12:43.130
Your power is every bit as
amazing as the rumors say!

00:12:43.130 --> 00:12:47.380
Listen, Honey. Wouldn't you feel much better

00:12:47.380 --> 00:12:49.740
if Kojou-san were to return to our country with us?

00:12:49.740 --> 00:12:51.080
H-Hey... What are you saying?!

00:12:51.810 --> 00:12:57.460
Akatsuki Kojou-san, would you come to Aldegyr to take my daughter's hand?

00:12:58.710 --> 00:13:00.840
Thank you very much, Mother!

00:13:01.240 --> 00:13:02.670
No way!

00:13:02.670 --> 00:13:04.800
Wait, Your Majesty!

00:13:05.280 --> 00:13:06.520
The Fourth Progenitor is under

00:13:06.520 --> 00:13:08.510
the Japanese government's surveillance.

00:13:08.510 --> 00:13:11.200
If he were to leave for Aldegyr, well...

00:13:11.200 --> 00:13:12.310
It would be reckless...

00:13:12.310 --> 00:13:14.720
Oh? But does the treaty not say,

00:13:14.720 --> 00:13:16.760
"Insofar as a demon does not transgress,

00:13:16.760 --> 00:13:20.100
he or she has freedom of movement."

00:13:20.920 --> 00:13:23.440
Be that as it may...

00:13:23.440 --> 00:13:24.780
Then, let's leave it there for tonight.

00:13:25.200 --> 00:13:27.740
It has gotten quite late.

00:13:28.290 --> 00:13:30.690
I'd like you all to spend the night here,

00:13:30.690 --> 00:13:33.660
and we can pick up where we left off tomorrow.

00:13:33.660 --> 00:13:34.290
But—

00:13:34.290 --> 00:13:35.500
Thank you very much!

00:13:36.420 --> 00:13:39.660
Everyone must be tired.
You're very generous, Your Majesty.

00:13:39.660 --> 00:13:40.900
Akatsuki Kojou!

00:13:40.900 --> 00:13:41.670
You keep your mouth shut!

00:13:42.260 --> 00:13:43.660
Let it go.

00:13:43.660 --> 00:13:47.380
If you're worried, then just come
watch me all night long, Kirasaka.

00:13:49.240 --> 00:13:49.760
Okay?

00:13:52.680 --> 00:13:54.220
That solves that.

00:13:57.070 --> 00:14:00.630
La Folia-san never fails to surprise us.

00:14:00.630 --> 00:14:02.700
All this sudden talk of marriage...

00:14:05.520 --> 00:14:06.860
Sayaka-san?

00:14:07.140 --> 00:14:08.980
O-Oh, nothing!

00:14:08.980 --> 00:14:11.780
The queen knows how to put us in a bind!

00:14:11.780 --> 00:14:14.600
She took La Folia's joke literally.

00:14:15.140 --> 00:14:17.250
I sure hope she's joking.

00:14:18.410 --> 00:14:22.060
Because she could really take this all the way.

00:14:22.060 --> 00:14:24.710
If he really gets roped into this...

00:14:24.710 --> 00:14:26.250
Maybe...

00:14:26.250 --> 00:14:28.300
Are you worried about him?

00:14:28.900 --> 00:14:31.960
I-I'm just worried as his observer!

00:14:31.960 --> 00:14:33.500
That's all!

00:14:35.390 --> 00:14:38.780
La Folia-san proposes to
Kojou-kun out of the blue, huh?

00:14:38.780 --> 00:14:41.730
Just when did Kojou-san become a ladies' man?

00:14:42.290 --> 00:14:46.740
From what I heard, the queen told her to marry whoever she wants.

00:14:47.130 --> 00:14:50.740
Oh, come to think of it, they've kissed.

00:14:50.740 --> 00:14:52.720
Maybe that's where it started!

00:14:53.500 --> 00:14:56.750
But I can't bear the thought
of Kojou-kun leaving me either...

00:14:56.750 --> 00:14:59.960
Oh, but this means Kanon-chan and I will be related!

00:14:59.960 --> 00:15:02.550
That sweetens the deal!

00:15:04.930 --> 00:15:06.920
You want me to stay the night?

00:15:06.920 --> 00:15:10.580
Yes, Her Majesty insists on it.

00:15:10.580 --> 00:15:11.320
You should do it.

00:15:11.320 --> 00:15:12.180
Stay the night.

00:15:12.920 --> 00:15:16.410
Your competition won't wait for you.

00:15:16.410 --> 00:15:18.310
Her family is on board with the marriage too.

00:15:18.310 --> 00:15:21.150
Worst case, they'll get ahead of you tonight.

00:15:22.000 --> 00:15:25.500
If you don't wanna lose,
then win before they can beat you.

00:15:27.380 --> 00:15:29.940
What's wrong? You look down.

00:15:29.940 --> 00:15:31.700
Oh, nothing. I'm fine!

00:15:32.520 --> 00:15:35.120
Hey, Nagisa-chan, I'm going to get in the bath.

00:15:35.880 --> 00:15:39.580
I have texts to send, so you go on ahead!

00:15:40.890 --> 00:15:43.540
Wow, this bath is huge!

00:15:44.080 --> 00:15:46.500
It looks like the bath on the Oceanus Grave II!

00:15:48.500 --> 00:15:51.430
Speaking of, that was when he suddenly walked in...

00:15:59.490 --> 00:16:00.640
Hey, Asagi!

00:16:02.080 --> 00:16:06.020
K-Kojou?! How? Why are you here?!

00:16:06.600 --> 00:16:08.300
What do you expect?

00:16:08.300 --> 00:16:13.490
They gave me a room in a suite,
but the only bath on this floor is here!

00:16:13.940 --> 00:16:15.950
It's not surprising that we'd run into each other.

00:16:17.110 --> 00:16:19.290
Though, I'm not complaining.

00:16:19.750 --> 00:16:22.250
S-Sorry! I'll leave.

00:16:24.050 --> 00:16:25.720
What's the matter?

00:16:25.720 --> 00:16:27.670
We're here together for once.

00:16:27.670 --> 00:16:29.950
Unless, I'm the reason you're leaving...

00:16:30.550 --> 00:16:31.420
Kojou...

00:16:31.910 --> 00:16:33.660
Trust me.

00:16:33.660 --> 00:16:34.800
I won't do anything bad.

00:16:35.670 --> 00:16:37.720
But we haven't talked much lately.

00:16:38.380 --> 00:16:40.500
So why don't we relax for a minute and catch up?

00:16:41.420 --> 00:16:42.600
Kojou...

00:16:44.470 --> 00:16:45.730
Onii-san?

00:16:45.730 --> 00:16:47.060
I-It's not what you think!

00:16:47.060 --> 00:16:47.880
We're just—

00:16:47.880 --> 00:16:50.760
Kanase? And Astarte?

00:16:50.760 --> 00:16:51.590
Great timing.

00:16:51.590 --> 00:16:53.900
Wanna take a bath with us?

00:16:53.900 --> 00:16:55.820
If you want, I'll even scrub your backs for you.

00:16:55.820 --> 00:16:56.990
W-Wait, Kojou!

00:16:57.780 --> 00:16:59.250
Accept.

00:17:00.560 --> 00:17:03.250
If you say so.

00:17:03.960 --> 00:17:07.750
Wait! Why didn't you girls refuse?

00:17:07.750 --> 00:17:09.340
Kojou, why did you say that?

00:17:09.840 --> 00:17:11.870
Relax.

00:17:11.870 --> 00:17:14.560
I just wanted to have fun with everyone.

00:17:14.560 --> 00:17:17.860
I'll scrub your back too, if that's the problem.

00:17:17.860 --> 00:17:20.350
And if you really want me to,
I'll get in all the corners too.

00:17:21.440 --> 00:17:27.400
Kojou, you stupid, lecherous,
perverted molester! Get out, you horndog!

00:17:27.400 --> 00:17:31.780
You can just get engaged
and leave for Aldegyr for all I care!

00:17:31.780 --> 00:17:33.900
All right, you just want me to leave, right?

00:17:38.410 --> 00:17:39.700
Huh?

00:17:39.700 --> 00:17:40.660
Senpai?!

00:17:41.410 --> 00:17:42.760
Hey, girls!

00:17:42.760 --> 00:17:44.800
Have a nice bath.

00:17:51.670 --> 00:17:53.060
I can't believe this!

00:17:53.060 --> 00:17:58.390
They put both men and women in a suite of unlocked rooms, with only a single bath!

00:17:58.390 --> 00:18:01.350
What is the Aldegyrian Embassy doing?!

00:18:01.890 --> 00:18:05.530
It was probably La Folia-san's decision.

00:18:05.530 --> 00:18:07.820
Curse her... Okay, we have to do something.

00:18:07.820 --> 00:18:09.060
Do what?!

00:18:09.800 --> 00:18:12.520
We need to be more proactive.

00:18:12.520 --> 00:18:14.300
We could change the room assignments.

00:18:14.300 --> 00:18:17.240
I'm going to ask that Kojou
be placed in a room with a lock.

00:18:17.900 --> 00:18:23.250
Yukina, you protect Kojou from
that vixen's claws until I get back!

00:18:24.620 --> 00:18:28.250
This is clearly a part of our mission
as members of the Lion King Organization.

00:18:28.920 --> 00:18:32.570
You'll watch over the Fourth Progenitor,
so as to prevent any misconduct!

00:18:32.570 --> 00:18:33.710
I'm counting on you!

00:18:45.710 --> 00:18:46.600
Himeragi?

00:18:46.600 --> 00:18:50.090
Excuse me, Senpai, could we talk for a moment?

00:18:50.090 --> 00:18:50.880
Sure.

00:18:53.710 --> 00:18:56.740
What brings you here in the middle of the night?

00:18:57.570 --> 00:18:59.990
I'm... here to watch over you!

00:19:08.210 --> 00:19:09.370
Oh?

00:19:09.370 --> 00:19:11.940
But I was about to go to sleep.

00:19:11.940 --> 00:19:16.040
I'm sorry. Something came up.

00:19:16.040 --> 00:19:17.360
I understand.

00:19:17.360 --> 00:19:19.470
So you wanna observe me?
How about from under the covers?

00:19:19.940 --> 00:19:23.000
S-Stop kidding around!

00:19:24.360 --> 00:19:25.680
I'm not kidding.

00:19:26.370 --> 00:19:28.270
I always joke about it,

00:19:28.270 --> 00:19:30.700
but sometimes I really do lose self-control.

00:19:31.340 --> 00:19:33.150
Because you're just too beautiful.

00:19:33.740 --> 00:19:35.110
Is that so wrong?

00:19:35.110 --> 00:19:36.860
Stay away!

00:19:45.650 --> 00:19:48.330
Sayaka-san will be back soon!

00:19:48.330 --> 00:19:51.950
If she catches us in the act, she will really kill you!

00:19:51.950 --> 00:19:52.710
So get off me, now!

00:19:52.710 --> 00:19:55.170
If I'm going to die, then I want you to finish the job.

00:19:57.780 --> 00:19:58.820
Himeragi...

00:19:59.380 --> 00:20:02.090
Senpai... you're such a...

00:20:02.090 --> 00:20:05.450
player... aren't you?

00:20:08.400 --> 00:20:11.230
Oh, my. It appears that I'm late to the party.

00:20:12.050 --> 00:20:13.220
La Folia?

00:20:13.220 --> 00:20:15.980
T-This isn't what it looks like!

00:20:15.980 --> 00:20:18.740
Oh, I don't mind. Keep going.

00:20:18.740 --> 00:20:22.480
Oh! Would you prefer a threesome?

00:20:22.480 --> 00:20:25.530
I'd definitely welcome Yukina as your second wife!

00:20:26.130 --> 00:20:27.490
I look forward to that.

00:20:27.970 --> 00:20:28.490
Oh?

00:20:30.410 --> 00:20:31.500
Senpai?

00:20:33.730 --> 00:20:37.110
But... we don't have time for that.

00:20:40.940 --> 00:20:41.550
La Folia-san?!

00:20:42.650 --> 00:20:43.840
Senpai...

00:20:43.840 --> 00:20:44.510
What are you doing?!

00:20:56.690 --> 00:20:59.980
I'd rather not come in, but I'm going
to anyways, Akatsuki Kojou!

00:20:59.980 --> 00:21:01.450
Are you there, Yukina?

00:21:02.090 --> 00:21:04.800
Actually, I couldn't find La Folia.

00:21:09.720 --> 00:21:10.700
Yukina?

00:21:27.890 --> 00:21:31.850
We even got a two-for-one deal,
everything went better than expected.

00:21:34.810 --> 00:21:36.650
But the real test is tomorrow.

00:21:36.650 --> 00:21:39.530
I have so much in store for you,

00:21:39.530 --> 00:21:41.060
Fourth Progenitor.

00:21:43.380 --> 00:21:45.480
Yes, My Lady!
